[[File:Oathplate helm chathead.png|left]]
'''Oathplate armour''' is a set of equipment requiring level 78 [[Defence]] to equip. 

The individual pieces are obtainable directly as a drop from [[Yama]] or more rarely through the [[forgotten lockbox]], which Yama also drops.

Alternately, they can be created with 78 [[Mining]] and 83 [[Smithing]], both of which are boostable. This method requires players to combine 2,520 [[crushed infernal shale]] with 450 [[oathplate shards]] to create 9 [[infernal plate]]s needed to create a piece of armour. Approximately 22,000 Smithing xp is earned in creating one piece of oathplate armour. The shale is minable, while the shards are a drop from Yama. As Yama is a Zamorakian demon, the set pieces count as Zamorakian items for the [[God Wars Dungeon]].

This set can be stored in the [[armour case space]] of a [[costume room]] in a [[player-owned house]]. [[Ultimate Ironmen]] will be unable to retrieve individual pieces until the full set is stored. 

